Value Required MAC_ADDRESS ([0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4})
Value Required VLAN_ID (\d+)
Value PORT (\S+)
Value TYPE (\S+)

# One record per MAC entry learned in a VLAN (eNSP Pro CE6800, YunShan OS 1.25.1.1).
# The VLAN/VSI/BD column reads "10/-/-"; an entry in a VSI or bridge domain is not
# verified yet and is refused. The age is not modeled.
Start
  ^\d{4}-\d\d-\d\d \d\d:\d\d:\d\d(?:\.\d+)?\s*$$
  ^Flags: .*$$
  ^\s+# - forwarding logical interface.*$$
  ^\s+on the interface\.\s*$$
  ^BD\s+: bridge-domain.*$$
  ^-+\s*$$
  ^MAC Address\s+VLAN/VSI/BD\s+Learned-From\s+Type\s+Age\s*$$
  ^${MAC_ADDRESS}\*?\s+${VLAN_ID}/-/-\s+${PORT}\s+${TYPE}(?:\s+\d+|\s+-)?\s*$$ -> Record
  ^Total items:\s*\d+\s*$$
  ^\s*$$
  ^. -> Error "unrecognized display mac-address line"
